caution ...\n~~ only this is red ;-) ~~ <!-- class = \"animated infinite bounce\" style = \"color: red;\" -->\n\n## Diagrams\n\n``` ascii  Fig.: ASCII art is rendered as an image\n+------+   +-----+   +-----+\n|      |   |     |   |     |\n| Foo  +-->| Bar +-->| Baz |\n|      |   |     |   |     |\n+------+   +-----+   +-----+\n```\n\nTables with numbers can be shown as charts:\n\n<!-- data-show data-title=\"Powers\" data-xlabel=\"x\" data-ylabel=\"y\" -->\n| x | square | cube |\n| - | -----: | ---: |\n| 0 |      0 |    0 |\n| 1 |      1 |    1 |\n| 2 |      4 |    8 |\n| 3 |      9 |   27 |\n\n## Quizzes\n\n### A Textquiz\n\nWhat did the **fish** say when he hit a **concrete wall**?\n\n    [[dam]]\n    [[?]] It is a pun.\n\n### Multiple Choice\n\nJust add as many points as you wish:\n\n    [[X]] Only the **X** marks the correct point.\n    [[ ]] Empty ones are wrong.\n    [[X]] ...\n\n### Single Choice\n\nJust add as many points as you wish:\n\n    [( )] ...\n    [(X)] <-- Only the **X** is correct.\n    [( )] ...\n\n### Gap Text\n\nThe capital of France is [[ Paris ]] and of Italy [[ (Rome) | Milan | Naples ]].\n\n## Survey\n\nHow do you like LiaScript so far?\n\n    [(1)] great\n    [(2)] okay\n    [(3)] not yet\n\n## Executable Code\n\nCode blocks with a script tag can be edited and executed:\n\n```javascript\nlet sum = 0;\nfor (let i = 1; i <= 10; i++) { sum += i; }\nsum;\n```\n<script>@input</script>\n\n\n### Projects\n\nYou can make your code executable and define projects:\n\n``` js     -EvalScript.js\nlet who = data.first_name + \" \" + data.last_name;\n\nif(data.online) {\n  who + \" is online\"; }\nelse {\n  who + \" is NOT online\"; }\n```\n``` json    +Data.json\n{\n  \"first_name\" :  \"Sammy\",\n  \"last_name\"  :  \"Shark\",\n  \"online\"     :  true\n}\n```\n<script>\n  // insert the JSON dataset into the local variable data\n  let data = @input(1);\n\n  // eval the script that uses this dataset\n  eval(`@input(0)`);\n</script>\n\n## More\n\nFind out what else you can do:\n\nhttps://liascript.github.io/course/?https://raw.githubusercontent.com/liaScript/docs/master/README.md",
